        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">4+ Invul Sv against shooting/explosions; 5+ Invul Sv against close combat. If the Aiakos suffers a &apos;Vehicle Explodes&apos; damage result, add +2&quot; to blast radius.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Auspex" id="54eb0acc-bcd4-8340-5a46-db83a28727b2" hidden="false" page="0" publicationId="d227da84--pubN66388" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model with an auspex can use it in place of making a shooting attack. If he does so, target an enemy unit within 12&quot; (this does not count as choosing a target for his unit to shoot at). A unit that is targeted by one or more auspexes has its cover saves reduced by 1 until the end of the phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
