    <profile name="Power Capacitor" id="eb9e-e590-d1a0-a684" hidden="false" publicationId="d227da84--pubN84058" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Capacitor Fire: If the Vindicator Tank Destroyer has not moved this turn, the laser destroyer array becomes an Ordnance 2, Twin-linked weapon. Overcharged Fire: The owning player may declare an overcharged volley if the vehicle has not moved this turn, in which case the laser destroyer array becomes Ordnance 3, Twin-linked. However, after the weapon is fired in this mode, roll a D6. On a roll of a 1, the Vindicator suffers a single Hull Point of damage.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
