    <profile name="The Tempered Helm" id="a78fe1e3-3d94-8122-698a-375bb152c2e9" hidden="false" page="89" publicationId="d227da84--pubN81691" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When taking Morale tests, all friendly units within 24&quot; of the bearer can use his Ld instead of their own. Furthermore, nominate a single friendly unit within 12&quot; of  the bearer at the start of  each of  his Shooting phases. That unit can reroll all To Hit rolls of a 1 in that Shooting phase.  Both of these rules can be used even if the bearer is embarked in a vehicle or building.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="The Tome of Vel&apos;cona" id="7af4-8bdd-d0c4-2b98" hidden="false" page="95" publicationId="d227da84--pubN81691" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Bearer knows the Pyromancy discipline power Molten Beam in addition to any others he knows. This is not considered when determining Psychic Focus. In addition, the bearer can add +1 Strength to all Pyromancy witchfire powers he uses.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
