    <rule name="Grenade Harness" id="659ff44e-b4b4-e754-d640-1207926a1f5b" hidden="false" page="83" publicationId="d227da84--pubN81691">
      <description>A model can fire its grenade harness in addition to its combi-bolter. In addition, models in the wearer&apos;s unit do not suffer the penalty to their Initiative for charging enemies through difficult terrain, but fight at their normal Initiative in the ensuing combat.</description>
    </rule>
