    <rule name="Orbital Array" id="cff8-01c5-a8f4-241d" hidden="false" publicationId="d227da84--pubN88031">
      <description>At the start of each turn after your first, choose to either Coordinate Reinforcements or call an Orbital Alpha Strike. Iif you choose to Coordinate Reinforcements, choose a unit in reserves. That unit automatically arrives this turn.</description>
